ast-font-family: 휴먼명조;\">미등록</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">·</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조;\">미복학 및 학사경고 누적 등의 사유로 제적된 자<span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span><o:p></o:p></span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 180%; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">2. </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조;\">자격 제한</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 180%; text-indent: -41pt; margin-left: 41pt; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; 가</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조;\">학생활동 등으로 제적된 자 중 개전의 정이 없는 자</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 180%; -ms-text-autospac